I am going to Fort Kochi.
I arrive at the Ernakulam boat jetty.
I buy a ticket from there.
This boat goes to Fort Kochi.
I get into the boat.
I look at the time.
The heavy rain stopped twenty minutes ago.
Now there is no rain.
The boat departs from the jetty.
I look outside through the window.
There is a good cold breeze now.
This journey is very peaceful.
There are other boats in the water.
That is a big ship.
That ship is very far.
After some time, we reach Fort Kochi.
I get out of the boat.
